  93:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c **** 
  94:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c **** /**
  95:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * @brief Programs a speed ramp for Motor 1 for later or immediate execution.
  96:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *
  97:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *  A speed ramp is a linear change from the current speed reference to the @p hFinalSpeed
  98:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * target speed in the given @p hDurationms time.
  99:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *
 100:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *  Invoking the MC_ProgramSpeedRampMotor1() function programs a new speed ramp
 101:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * with the provided parameters. The programmed ramp is executed immediately if
 102:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * Motor 1's state machine is in the #START_RUN or #RUN states. Otherwise, the
 103:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * ramp is buffered and will be executed when the state machine reaches any of
 104:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * the aforementioned state.
 105:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *
 106:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *  The Application can check the status of the command with the MC_GetCommandStateMotor1()
 107:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * to know whether the last command was executed immediately or not.
 108:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *
 109:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * Only one command can be buffered at any given time. If another ramp - whether a
 110:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * speed or a torque one - or if another buffered command is programmed before the
 111:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * current one has completed, the latter replaces the former.
 112:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *
 113:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * @note A ramp cannot reverse the rotation direction if the Application is using
 114:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * sensorless motor control techniques. If the sign of the hFinalSpeed parameter
 115:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * differs from that of the current speed, the ramp will not complete and a Speed
 116:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * Feedback error (#MC_SPEED_FDBK) will occur when the rotation speed is about to
 117:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * reach 0 rpm.
 118:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *
 119:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * @param  hFinalSpeed Mechanical rotor speed reference at the end of the ramp.
 120:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *                     Expressed in the unit defined by #SPEED_UNIT.
 121:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * @param  hDurationms Duration of the ramp expressed in milliseconds. It
 122:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *         is possible to set 0 to perform an instantaneous change in the speed
 123:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *         value.
 124:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   */
 125:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c **** __weak void MC_ProgramSpeedRampMotor1( int16_t hFinalSpeed, uint16_t hDurationms )
 126:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c **** {
