 168:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *
 169:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *  Invoking the MC_ProgramCurrentRampsMotor1() function programs a new current ramp
 170:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * with the provided parameters. The programmed ramp is executed immediately if
 171:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * Motor 1's state machine is in the #START_RUN or #RUN states. Otherwise, the
 172:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * ramp is buffered and will be executed when the state machine reaches any of
 173:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * the aforementioned state.
