 178:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * Only one command can be buffered at any given time. If another ramp - whether a
 179:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * torque or a speed one - or if another buffered command is programmed before the
 180:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * current one has completed, the latter replaces the former.
