 184:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * @param  hDurationms Duration of the ramp expressed in milliseconds. It
 185:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *         is possible to set 0 to perform an instantaneous change in the torque
 186:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *         value.
 187:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   */
