 201:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * command is buffered and will be executed when the state machine reaches any of
 202:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * the aforementioned state.
 203:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *
 204:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *  The Application can check the status of the command with the MC_GetCommandStateMotor1()
 205:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * to know whether the last command was executed immediately or not.
 206:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *
 207:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * Only one command can be buffered at any given time. If another buffered command is
