 218:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c **** /**
 219:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * @brief  Returns the status of the last buffered command for Motor 1.
 220:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * The status can be one of the following values:
 221:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * - #MCI_BUFFER_EMPTY: no buffered command is currently programmed.
 222:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * - #MCI_COMMAND_NOT_ALREADY_EXECUTED: A command has been buffered but the conditions for its
 223:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *   execution have not occurred yet. The command is still in the buffer, pending execution.
 224:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * - #MCI_COMMAND_EXECUTED_SUCCESFULLY: the last buffered command has been executed successfully.
 225:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *   In this case calling this function reset the command state to #BC_BUFFER_EMPTY.
 226:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   * - #MCI_COMMAND_EXECUTED_UNSUCCESFULLY: the buffered command has been executed unsuccessfully.
 227:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   *   In this case calling this function reset the command state to #BC_BUFFER_EMPTY.
 228:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****   */
