 234:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c **** /**
 235:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****  * @brief Stops the execution of the on-going speed ramp for Motor 1, if any.
 236:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****  *
 237:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****  *  If a speed ramp is currently being executed, it is immediately stopped, the rotation
 238:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****  * speed of Motor 1 is maintained to its current value and true is returned. If no speed
 239:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****  * ramp is on-going, nothing is done and false is returned.
 240:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****  *
 241:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****  * @deprecated This function is deprecated and should not be used anymore. It will be
 242:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****  *             removed in a future version of the STELLAR_PMSM_MC_FOC_LIBRARY. Use MC_StopRampMotor
 243:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c ****  */
 244:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_api.c **** __weak bool MC_StopSpeedRampMotor1(void)
